  "notes": "{漏|も}らす means to let something escape or slip out, either physically or informationally.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{漏|も}れる→漏れる：02435_moreru⟧ (intransitive, something leaks out)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Physical leaking: ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす (to leak water)\n2. Information: ⟦{秘密|ひみつ}→秘密：02504_himitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす (to divulge a secret)\n3. Omitting: ⟦{名前|なまえ}→名前：02234_namae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす (to leave out a name)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{秘密|ひみつ}→秘密：02504_himitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす: to let slip a secret\n- ⟦{情報|じょうほう}→情報：03348_jouhou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす: to leak information\n- ⟦{本音|ほんね}→本音：06620_honne⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす: to let one's true feelings slip\n- ⟦ため{息|いき}→溜息：04502_tameiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{漏|も}らす: to let out a sigh",
